hey Guardians here to give you a quick  update on the Queen's wrath event  currently live on the Destiny servers  the event brought with it a new set of  bounties for you to complete Queens  wrath missions as well as a new MPC pet  revenge the Queen's emissary she sells  legendary shaders emblems a class armor  and some rare weapons will be  interesting to see if her inventory  changes when you hit level 3 in the  Queen's wrath reputation as her current  stock of items seems lacking the key  thing to note here is that by completing  a queen's wrath bounty you'll not only  earn queen's favor but you will also  unlock a queen's wrath mission you will  notice this in both your inventory under  the missions area as well as on the  orbit map on the left hand side the  Queen's wrath mission will always have  the modifier epic which makes for  heavily shielded and highly aggressive  enemies to appear in great numbers as  well as two other modifiers that are  mission-specific once you've launched  the Queen's wrath mission it will then  select a random mission from the game  for you to complete I personally came  across 526 various missions such as the  mission to defeat traxxas winter quell  the mission to retrieve a gate Lords  head stopping the shrine Oryx and even  one of the very first missions to  retrieve a warp drive for your ship in  the Cosmodrome the mission to retrieve  the warp drive is by far the easiest  quest within the ones that I was given  this mission only requires you to deal  with a small handful of enemies and a  boss who is relatively easy and does not  have any big threatening damage make  sure to target the shanks first because  I have heavy shielding they do however  fall from to proper shots from receber  rifle after defeating the boss with just  a few well-placed tempor shots to the  head finish some mission and receive  your Queens wrath legendary gear the  best way to take advantage of the  current system is to make sure you get  the mission to retrieve the warp drive  you can do this by restarting the  Queen's wrath mission over and over  until you get the mission to retrieve  the warp drive currently there is no  punishment for abandoning the missions  to start a new one this is the easiest  and fastest way to get some of the new  Queens wrath legendary gear and is also  a good way to farm ascendant shards to  upgrade your existing legendary and  exotic armors  you
 

